<title>USA: Connie Lee Insurance says net income up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Connie Lee Insurance says net income up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Connie Lee Insurance Co said Tuesday its consolidated net income rose 25 percent in the third quarter to $2.9 million from 2.3 million in third quarter 1995.</p>
<p>For the first nine months, net income was $8 million compared to $5.9 million in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Connie Lee, which is becoming privately owned, said revenues for the third quarter rose to $5.6 million from $5.1 million last year.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
